<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>GG IELTS Reading Architect v11.2 - GG Languages Academy</title>
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/css/all.min.css">
    <script src="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/mammoth/1.8.0/mammoth.browser.min.js"></script>
    <script src="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/jszip/3.10.1/jszip.min.js"></script>
    <style>
        :root {
            --brand-primary: #1e4620; --brand-accent: #2e7d32; --brand-light: #e8f5e9;
            --bg-color: #f0f4f8; --surface: #ffffff; --border: #d1d5db;
            --text-main: #1f2937; --text-sub: #6b7280; --radius: 14px;
        }
        *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; }
        body { font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; background-color: var(--bg-color); color: var(--text-main); margin: 0; padding: 28px 20px; }
        .container { max-width: 920px; margin: 0 auto; }

        .app-header { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 16px; margin-bottom: 28px; padding-bottom: 22px; border-bottom: 2px solid #e5e7eb; }
        .logo-img { height: 58px; filter: drop-shadow(0 2px 6px rgba(30,70,32,0.18)); }
        .app-title h1 { margin: 0; font-size: 1.55rem; font-weight: 800; color: var(--brand-primary); letter-spacing: -0.5px; }
        .app-title .sub { font-size: 0.82rem; color: var(--text-sub); font-weight: 500; margin-top: 2px; }
        .version-chip { display: inline-block; background: var(--brand-light); color: var(--brand-accent); font-size: 0.7rem; font-weight: 800; padding: 2px 8px; border-radius: 20px; margin-left: 8px; vertical-align: middle; letter-spacing: 0.5px; border: 1px solid #a5d6a7; }

        .card { background: var(--surface); border-radius: var(--radius); border: 1px solid var(--border); padding: 36px; box-shadow: 0 4px 6px -1px rgb(0 0 0 / 0.07), 0 10px 24px -4px rgb(0 0 0 / 0.08); }

        .field-group { margin-bottom: 24px; }
        .title-compose { display: flex; align-items: stretch; border: 1.5px solid var(--border);
                         border-radius: 9px; overflow: hidden; background: #fdfdfd; transition: 0.18s; }
        .title-compose:focus-within { border-color: var(--brand-accent); box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(46,125,50,0.12); }
        .title-fixed { display: flex; align-items: center; padding: 13px 15px; background: #f1f5f9;
                       color: var(--brand-primary); font-weight: 700; font-size: 0.93rem;
                       white-space: nowrap; border-right: 1.5px solid var(--border); }
        .title-compose input[type="text"] { border: none !important; border-radius: 0 !important;
                       background: transparent !important; box-shadow: none !important;
                       width: 130px; font-weight: 800; color: var(--brand-primary); }
        @media (max-width: 640px) {
            .title-compose { flex-direction: column; }
            .title-fixed { border-right: none; border-bottom: 1.5px solid var(--border); font-size: 0.82rem; }
            .title-compose input[type="text"] { width: 100%; }
        }
        .field-hint { font-size: 0.76rem; color: var(--text-sub); font-weight: 500; line-height: 1.6;
                      margin: -3px 0 11px; }
        .field-hint b { color: var(--brand-primary); font-weight: 700; }
        .opt-chip { text-transform: none; letter-spacing: 0; font-weight: 700; font-size: 0.63rem;
                    color: var(--text-sub); background: #eef2f6; padding: 2px 9px; border-radius: 20px; }
        .field-label { font-size: 0.72rem; font-weight: 800; color: var(--text-sub); margin-bottom: 9px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 1px; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; }
        input[type="text"], textarea {
            width: 100%; padding: 13px 16px; border: 1.5px solid var(--border); border-radius: 9px;
            font-size: 0.97rem; font-family: inherit; transition: 0.18s; background: #fdfdfd; color: var(--text-main);
        }
        input:focus, textarea:focus { outline: none; border-color: var(--brand-accent); background: #fff; box-shadow: 0 0 0 4px rgba(46,125,50,0.1); }
        textarea { height: 440px; resize: vertical; line-height: 1.65; }

        .api-status.missing { background: #fffbeb; border-color: #fcd34d; }
        .api-status.missing span { color: #92400e; }
        .api-status.missing .api-dot { background: #f59e0b; box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(245,158,11,0.2); }
        .key-btn { margin-left: auto; background: transparent; border: 1px solid currentColor; color: inherit;
                   font-family: inherit; font-size: 0.7rem; font-weight: 700; padding: 4px 11px;
                   border-radius: 6px; cursor: pointer; opacity: 0.75; }
        .key-btn:hover { opacity: 1; }
        .key-form { display: none; border: 1.5px solid var(--border); border-radius: 12px;
                    padding: 18px; margin: -12px 0 24px; background: #fcfdfc; }
        .key-form.open { display: block; }
        .key-row { display: flex; gap: 10px; }
        .key-row input { flex: 1; }
        .key-save { padding: 0 22px; border: none; border-radius: 9px; background: var(--brand-primary);
                    color: #fff; font-family: inherit; font-weight: 800; font-size: 0.85rem; cursor: pointer; }
        .key-save:hover { background: #256427; }
        .key-err { color: #dc2626; font-size: 0.76rem; font-weight: 600; margin-top: 9px; display: none; }
        .key-err.show { display: block; }

        .key-orb { margin-left: auto; width: 13px; height: 13px; border-radius: 50%; border: none;
                   padding: 0; cursor: pointer; flex-shrink: 0; background: #86c98a;
                   transition: transform 0.15s, box-shadow 0.15s; }
        .key-orb:hover { transform: scale(1.35); }
        .key-orb.missing { background: #f59e0b; box-shadow: 0 0 0 0 rgba(245,158,11,0.7);
                           animation: orbPulse 1.9s infinite; }
        @keyframes orbPulse {
            70%  { box-shadow: 0 0 0 9px rgba(245,158,11,0); }
            100% { box-shadow: 0 0 0 0 rgba(245,158,11,0); }
        }

        /* API key status indicator */
        .api-status { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; padding: 10px 14px; background: #f0fdf4; border: 1px solid #a5d6a7; border-radius: 9px; margin-bottom: 24px; }
        .api-dot { width: 9px; height: 9px; background: #22c55e; border-radius: 50%; flex-shrink: 0; box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(34,197,94,0.2); animation: pulse 2s ease-in-out infinite; }
        @keyframes pulse { 0%,100%{box-shadow:0 0 0 3px rgba(34,197,94,0.2)} 50%{box-shadow:0 0 0 6px rgba(34,197,94,0.08)} }
        .api-status span { font-size: 0.78rem; font-weight: 600; color: #166534; }

        .console-wrap { margin-bottom: 28px; }
        .console {
            background: #0c1829; color: #67e8f9; font-family: 'Consolas', 'Courier New', monospace;
            padding: 14px 18px; border-radius: 9px; font-size: 0.82rem; height: 115px;
            overflow-y: auto; border: 1px solid #1e3a5f; box-shadow: inset 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
        }
        .log-line  { margin-bottom: 4px; border-left: 3px solid #0ea5e9; padding-left: 11px; line-height: 1.5; }
        .log-err   { color: #fca5a5; border-color: #ef4444; font-weight: 700; }
        .log-ok    { color: #86efac; border-color: #22c55e; }
        .log-warn  { color: #fde68a; border-color: #f59e0b; }

        /* ---- Passage count selector ---- */
        .count-row { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr 1fr; gap: 10px; }
        .count-btn {
            padding: 14px 10px; border: 1.5px solid var(--border); background: #fdfdfd;
            border-radius: 10px; cursor: pointer; font-family: inherit; font-weight: 800;
            font-size: 0.86rem; color: var(--text-sub); transition: all 0.18s;
            display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: 4px;
        }
        .count-btn small { font-weight: 500; font-size: 0.67rem; opacity: 0.85; letter-spacing: 0.2px; }
        .count-btn:hover:not(:disabled) { border-color: var(--brand-accent); }
        .count-btn.active { background: var(--brand-light); border-color: var(--brand-accent); color: var(--brand-primary); box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(46,125,50,0.12); }
        .count-btn:disabled { opacity: 0.5; cursor: not-allowed; }

        /* ---- Mode switch: paste an existing test vs let the AI write one ---- */
        .mode-row { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 10px; }
        .mode-btn {
            padding: 15px 12px; border: 2px solid var(--border); background: #fdfdfd;
            border-radius: 10px; cursor: pointer; font-family: inherit; font-weight: 800;
            font-size: 0.88rem; color: var(--text-sub); transition: all 0.18s; text-align: left;
            display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px;
        }
        .mode-btn i { font-size: 1.15rem; opacity: 0.75; }
        .mode-btn small { display: block; font-weight: 500; font-size: 0.7rem; opacity: 0.85; margin-top: 2px; }
        .mode-btn:hover:not(:disabled) { border-color: var(--brand-accent); }
        .mode-btn:disabled { opacity: 0.5; cursor: not-allowed; }
        /* Convert = green (primary flow), Author = amber (secondary/alternate flow) —
           distinct color families so the two modes are unmistakable at a glance. */
        .mode-btn.convert.active { background: var(--brand-light); border-color: var(--brand-accent); color: var(--brand-primary); box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(46,125,50,0.14); }
        .mode-btn.convert.active i { opacity: 1; }
        .mode-btn.author.active { background: #fff8e1; border-color: #d97706; color: #92400e; box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(217,119,6,0.14); }
        .mode-btn.author.active i { opacity: 1; color: #d97706; }

        .type-chips { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px; }
        .type-chip {
            padding: 8px 13px; border: 1.5px solid var(--border); background: #fdfdfd;
            border-radius: 999px; cursor: pointer; font-family: inherit; font-weight: 700;
            font-size: 0.76rem; color: var(--text-sub); transition: all 0.16s;
        }
        .type-chip:hover:not(:disabled) { border-color: var(--brand-accent); }
        .type-chip.active { background: var(--brand-light); border-color: var(--brand-accent); color: var(--brand-primary); }
        .type-chip.auto.active { background: var(--brand-primary); border-color: var(--brand-primary); color: #fff; }
        .type-chip:disabled { opacity: 0.5; cursor: not-allowed; }
        .hidden-soft { display: none; }

        /* ---- Bilingual labels: Vietnamese primary, English small below ---- */
        .vi-label { display: block; }
        .en-label { display: block; font-size: 0.72em; font-weight: 500; opacity: 0.62; margin-top: 1px; letter-spacing: 0; text-transform: none; }

        /* ---- Whole-test quick paste / upload ---- */
        .quickpaste-box { border: 2px dashed var(--brand-accent); border-radius: 12px; padding: 18px;
                           background: #f6fbf6; margin-bottom: 10px; }
        .quickpaste-row { display: flex; gap: 10px; flex-wrap: wrap; margin-bottom: 12px; }
        .qp-upload-btn { border: 1.5px solid var(--brand-accent); background: #fff; color: var(--brand-primary);
                          border-radius: 9px; padding: 10px 16px; font-family: inherit; font-weight: 800;
                          font-size: 0.85rem; cursor: pointer; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; }
        .qp-upload-btn:hover { background: var(--brand-light); }
        .qp-split-btn { border: none; background: var(--brand-primary); color: #fff; border-radius: 9px;
                        padding: 10px 18px; font-family: inherit; font-weight: 800; font-size: 0.85rem;
                        cursor: pointer; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; }
        .qp-split-btn:hover { background: #256427; }
        .qp-status { font-size: 0.8rem; font-weight: 600; margin-top: 8px; }
        .qp-status.ok  { color: #166534; }
        .qp-status.err { color: #c0392b; }

        /* ---- Unified image-range manager ---- */
        .img-rows { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px; }
        .img-row { border: 1.5px solid var(--border); border-radius: 10px; padding: 12px 14px; background: #fdfdfd; }
        .img-add-btn { border: 1.5px dashed var(--brand-accent); background: #fff; color: var(--brand-primary);
                       border-radius: 9px; padding: 10px 16px; font-family: inherit; font-weight: 800;
                       font-size: 0.83rem; cursor: pointer; margin-top: 8px; }
        .img-add-btn:hover { background: var(--brand-light); }
        .img-range-inputs { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; font-size: 0.78rem; font-weight: 600; color: #64748b; }
        .img-range-inputs input { width: 58px; padding: 6px 8px !important; font-size: 0.8rem !important; text-align: center; }

        /* ---- Topic memory panel ---- */
        .hist-count { font-weight: 600; font-size: 0.72rem; opacity: 0.75; letter-spacing: 0; text-transform: none; }
        .hist-list {
            border: 1.5px solid var(--border); border-radius: 10px; background: #fdfdfd;
            max-height: 190px; overflow-y: auto; padding: 6px;
        }
        .hist-row {
            display: grid; grid-template-columns: 74px 1fr auto; gap: 10px; align-items: baseline;
            padding: 6px 8px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 0.8rem;
        }
        .hist-row:nth-child(odd) { background: rgba(0,0,0,0.025); }
        .hist-date { font-size: 0.7rem; opacity: 0.6; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
        .hist-ti   { color: var(--text-main); overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; white-space: nowrap; }
        .hist-lv   { font-size: 0.66rem; font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase; opacity: 0.55; }
        .hist-empty { padding: 12px 10px; font-size: 0.78rem; opacity: 0.65; line-height: 1.5; }
        .hist-btns { display: flex; gap: 8px; margin-top: 10px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
        .hist-btn {
            padding: 8px 14px; border: 1.5px solid var(--border); background: #fdfdfd; border-radius: 8px;
            cursor: pointer; font-family: inherit; font-weight: 700; font-size: 0.76rem; color: var(--text-sub);
            transition: all 0.16s; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px;
        }
        .hist-btn:hover { border-color: var(--brand-accent); color: var(--brand-primary); }
        .hist-btn.danger:hover { border-color: #c0392b; color: #c0392b; }
        .hist-io {
            display: none; width: 100%; margin-top: 10px; min-height: 76px; padding: 10px;
            border: 1.5px solid var(--border); border-radius: 8px; font-family: ui-monospace, Menlo, monospace;
            font-size: 0.72rem; resize: vertical;
        }

        /* ---- Per-passage input columns ---- */
        .img-attach { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; gap: 10px; }
        .img-pick { border: 1px solid var(--brand-accent); background: #f1f8f2; color: var(--brand); border-radius: 9px; padding: 8px 13px; font-family: inherit; font-weight: 700; font-size: 0.78rem; cursor: pointer; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; }
        .img-pick:hover { background: #e5f2e7; }
        .img-beforewrap { font-size: 0.76rem; color: #64748b; font-weight: 600; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; }
        .img-beforeq { width: 64px; padding: 6px 8px !important; font-size: 0.8rem !important; text-align: center; }
        .img-preview { flex-basis: 100%; }
        .img-preview.has { margin-top: 4px; }
        .img-preview img { max-height: 92px; max-width: 100%; border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 8px; vertical-align: middle; }
        .img-preview .img-rm { margin-left: 8px; color: #dc2626; font-size: 0.74rem; font-weight: 700; cursor: pointer; background: none; border: none; }
        .img-preview .img-name { font-size: 0.72rem; color: #64748b; margin-left: 6px; }

        .btn-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr 1fr; gap: 14px; }

        .gen-btn {
            padding: 0; border: none; border-radius: 13px; cursor: pointer;
            font-weight: 800; transition: all 0.22s cubic-bezier(.34,1.56,.64,1);
            position: relative; overflow: hidden; text-align: center;
        }
        .gen-btn:disabled { opacity: 0.38; cursor: not-allowed; transform: none !important; box-shadow: none !important; filter: none !important; }
        .gen-btn:hover:not(:disabled) { transform: translateY(-4px) scale(1.02); }
        .gen-btn:active:not(:disabled) { transform: translateY(-1px) scale(0.99); }

        .gen-btn .btn-inner { display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: 0; padding: 22px 14px 18px; position: relative; z-index: 1; }

        .level-icon { margin-bottom: 10px; display: block; }

        .btn-label { font-size: 0.9rem; font-weight: 800; color: white; letter-spacing: 0.2px; line-height: 1; }
        .btn-sub   { font-size: 0.68rem; font-weight: 500; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.72); margin-top: 5px; letter-spacing: 0.3px; }
        .btn-badge {
            position: absolute; top: 10px; right: 12px;
            font-size: 0.6rem; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: 0.5px;
            color: rgba(255,255,255,0.88); background: rgba(255,255,255,0.16);
            padding: 2px 7px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.22);
        }

        .pre  { background: linear-gradient(145deg, #1d6fa8 0%, #0d5c96 100%); box-shadow: 0 6px 20px rgba(13,92,150,0.35); }
        .pre:hover:not(:disabled)  { box-shadow: 0 12px 28px rgba(13,92,150,0.45); }
        .fund { background: linear-gradient(145deg, #f59e0b 0%, #d97706 100%); box-shadow: 0 6px 20px rgba(217,119,6,0.35); }
        .fund:hover:not(:disabled) { box-shadow: 0 12px 28px rgba(217,119,6,0.45); }
        .core { background: linear-gradient(145deg, #2e7d32 0%, #1b5e20 100%); box-shadow: 0 6px 20px rgba(27,94,32,0.38); }
        .core:hover:not(:disabled) { box-shadow: 0 12px 28px rgba(27,94,32,0.5); }

        .spin { display: none; width: 20px; height: 20px; border: 2.5px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.3); border-top-color: white; border-radius: 50%; animation: spin 0.7s linear infinite; margin: 0 auto 8px; }
        @keyframes spin { to { transform: rotate(360deg); } }
        .gen-btn.loading .spin { display: block; }
        .gen-btn.loading .level-icon { display: none; }

        /* ---- Label-only row (title/badges only, content preserved) ---- */
        .btn-grid.small .btn-inner   { padding: 10px 10px 8px; }
        .btn-grid.small .level-icon  { transform: scale(0.62); margin-bottom: 0; }
        .btn-grid.small .btn-label   { font-size: 0.74rem; }
        .btn-grid.small .btn-sub     { font-size: 0.58rem; margin-top: 2px; }
        .btn-grid.small .btn-badge   { font-size: 0.52rem; padding: 1px 5px; top: 6px; right: 8px; }
        .btn-grid.small .spin        { width: 15px; height: 15px; margin-bottom: 3px; }

        .grid-sep { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; margin: 18px 0; color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.68rem; font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.6px; }
        .grid-sep::before, .grid-sep::after { content: ''; flex: 1; height: 1px; background: #e2e8f0; }

        .ai-reduce-box { border: 1.5px solid #e2e8f0; border-radius: 14px; padding: 16px 16px 12px; background: #f8fafc; }

        .reduce-note { font-size: 0.72rem; color: #92400e; background: #fffbeb; border: 1px solid #f59e0b;
            border-radius: 8px; padding: 8px 12px; margin-top: 12px; line-height: 1.5; }
        .reduce-note .en { display: block; opacity: 0.75; margin-top: 2px; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="container">
    <header class="app-header">
        <img src="https://1drv.ms/i/c/cf90a27d1e2d64dd/IQSj_4BbUuwwTaAK8FBiFwC8AWjhNghEL4u78fASnBpZR9g?width=65&height=74" alt="GG Logo" class="logo-img">
        <div class="app-title">
            <h1>GG IELTS READING ARCHITECT <span class="version-chip">v11.2</span></h1>
            <div class="sub">Edited by Mr. Nhân &middot; 0984 351 477</div>
        </div>
        <button type="button" class="key-orb" id="keyOrb" onclick="toggleKeyForm()" title="API key"></button>
    </header>

    <div class="card">
        <div class="key-form" id="keyForm">
            <div class="field-label"><i class="fa-solid fa-key"></i> Anthropic API Key</div>
            <div class="field-hint">Stored in <b>this browser only</b> (localStorage) &mdash; it is never written into this file or into any test you generate. Get one at console.anthropic.com.</div>
            <div class="key-row">
                <input type="password" id="keyInput" placeholder="sk-ant-api03-&hellip;" autocomplete="off" spellcheck="false">
                <button type="button" class="key-save" onclick="saveKey()">Save</button>
            </div>
            <div class="key-err" id="keyErr"></div>
        </div>


        <div class="field-group">
            <div class="field-label"><i class="fa-solid fa-wand-magic-sparkles"></i> <span class="vi-label">Nguồn đề thi<span class="en-label">Test Source</span></span></div>
            <div class="mode-row">
                <button type="button" class="mode-btn convert active" id="mode-convert" onclick="setMode('convert')">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-paste"></i>
                    <span>DÁN ĐỀ CÓ SẴN<small>Bạn dán đề thật, AI chuẩn hoá &amp; chấm &middot; Convert an existing test</small></span>
                </button>
                <button type="button" class="mode-btn author" id="mode-author" onclick="setMode('author')">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-feather-pointed"></i>
                    <span>AI TỰ VIẾT ĐỀ<small>AI viết bài đọc gốc + bộ câu hỏi &middot; AI writes the test</small></span>
                </button>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="field-group hidden-soft" id="authorOpts">
            <div class="field-label"><i class="fa-solid fa-list-check"></i> Question Types</div>
            <div class="field-hint">Leave on <b>Auto</b> for an authentic Cambridge-style mix (each passage gets 3&ndash;4 different task types). Or pick specific types to drill one skill &mdash; useful when the lesson is about Matching Headings, for example. Diagram/map labelling is excluded: an AI-written passage has no figure.</div>
            <div class="type-chips" id="typeChips">
                <button type="button" class="type-chip auto active" data-t="auto" onclick="toggleType('auto')">AUTO &middot; Cambridge mix</button>
                <button type="button" class="type-chip" data-t="tfng" onclick="toggleType('tfng')">TRUE / FALSE / NOT GIVEN</button>
